WEBVTT

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.350
You sick-minded manipulator!

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:28.640
Don't you dare look at my sister so rudely!

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.310
The Prince...?

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:36.090
Brother.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.780
What's the matter, Sister?

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.160
I can't breathe!

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:47.940
Ferris, you always spoil Iris so.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.730
Work should be thoroughly executed.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:55.390
If we were to let a man like this live, it would sully the name of the Eris family, would it not?

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:58.410
What is your intent? Is the Prince behind this?

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.240
Then, does that mean Sion is also a prince?

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.410
The Eris family only serves the King of Roland.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.530
The true King.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:07.510
The King...?

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:11.130
We must see whether or not Sion would be a suitable king.

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:16.470
Will he make it back alive, faced with a troop of 50 Magic Knights?

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:20.100
Impossible.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.820
I could do it.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.790
Sion isn't you.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.390
Yes, he most certainly isn't. But he carries something.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:34.800
You met Sion, and as a result, you saved his life.

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.610
Don't you find that interesting?

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.020
I'm not particularly interested, no.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.770
Everyone not occupied, pitch the tents.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.260
I'm going to fetch some water!

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.690
Don't drag your feet.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:29.760
Hey, lend a hand with the tent-pitching, too!

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:32.000
It's a pain. I'll pass.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:34.740
Hey, Kiefer! Say something to Ryner!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:35.870
Oh, my poor stomach...

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:40.530
Ah... sorry, I didn't hear you.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:45.780
Kiefer, the layabout says he won't help with the tent-pitching.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.780
Ryner only listens to you, Kiefer.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.640
You bastard, you did something to Kiefer, didn't you?

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.660
Not a thing.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.450
She's definitely not herself, though.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.400
You're all so dense.

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:05.430
I mean, we're in a war!

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:09.530
When you think about what might happen to the one you love, of course it's depressing.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:13.370
Or did Kiefer say something to you before our dispatch?

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:21.690
Your dying scares me the most, Ryner.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.040
Hey, c'mon!

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:25.870
What?

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.720
Well, I'm off to fetch water.

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:30.790
We're off to the woods to gather some firewood.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:33.030
Huh? What about the tents?

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.330
Take care of it while we're out, okay?

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.590
Ah, it's so nice and clear out today, isn't it?

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.600
Good luck, Ryner!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:48.650
Then I guess I'll take an afternoon nap.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:04:58.420
Ryner...

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:03.980
Ryner, will you run away with me?

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.610
Hey, come with me.

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.640
Not with Sion. With me...

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.770
What are you talking about?

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:15.130
I love you, Ryner.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.730
I've always loved you.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:21.850
Even though it was hopeless, I couldn't help falling in love with you.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.590
Ryner, do you not like me?

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:36.890
Oh, come off it, Kiefer. Joking around at a time like this?

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:43.600
Yeah, you're right. I guess I can't have anything.

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.630
No, I didn't mean that...

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:49.250
Even so, I didn't want you to die.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.850
I'm sorry, Ryner. I couldn't protect you.

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.520
I offer up this contract,

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:01.400
to bear the spirit beast of light which sleeps within the atmosphere!

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:08.290
Goodbye.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.850
Tahile?

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.600
You think you can escape

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.670
from us, the Magic Knights of Estabul?

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.250
What's happening?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.660
An enemy raid from Estabul!

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.920
Red-armored knights are flooding in!

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.540
They're attacking us-

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:55.970
Red armor? The Estabul Magic Knights?

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.930
All hands, retreat!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.640
Run into the woods, fall back, and regroup!

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.010
Sion!

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:07.240
Are you alright?

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:12.550
No, not Tahile... He'd left to get water.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:16.180
He said we'd be safe as long as we stuck with you, Sion.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.200
What happened to Kiefer?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.220
I don't know.

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:21.760
Let's split up here.

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:24.140
Tony, Fahle, you two go on ahead.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:26.080
We'll stall them here.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.220
Sion!

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.170
Don't worry. Go!

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:37.380
Some of our own might still be alive, including Kiefer.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.080
You're going to go save them? That's impossible!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.760
It does seem that way.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:45.980
See them?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:46.610
No.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:54.730
What's wrong? Hurry and run, Roland brats!

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:57.870
If you don't run, you'll spoil our fun!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:05.530
I offer up this contract, to bear the spirit beast of light which sleeps within the atmosphere!

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:08.930
<i>Is he using that magic to accelerate?</i>

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:16.350
I offer up this contract, to bear the spirit beast of light which sleeps within the atmosphere!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:22.730
Are you okay?

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:25.940
Yes, but you... that magic...

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:30.220
You should know it. I didn't want to use it, though. Damn it.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:32.130
So, that was...

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:35.320
You! How did you use our magic?

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.160
No, he couldn't be-

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.570
An Alpha Stigma bearer?

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:41.990
The eyes said to bring forth disaster!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:46.610
I-I offer up this contract, to unleash...

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:48.620
Stop! Don't use magic!

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:53.470
I offer up this contract, to unleash the magic beast which dances through the skies!

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:05.930
If you had used that power sooner,
everyone would not have had to die!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.050
We only faced three of them, so we made it out alive.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:11.900
Besides, it's been seven years since I've used this power...

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:15.620
You gave us an interesting spectacle there.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.660
How rare to see an Alpha Stigma, you monster.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:36.600
Cower more! Amuse me, monster.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:39.310
You have the Alpha Stigma, don't you?

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:41.430
Show me something nice.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:45.950
Do you get it yet, monster? Those two are the only ones left.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:51.100
We killed the rest. All of them.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.690
All of them...?

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.970
Are you still calm after hearing that? You're so boring.

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:07.910
Hey!

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.830
Stop. Please, just stop...

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:24.210
People die. But it doesn't matter to you.

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:26.270
It doesn't matter.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.210
You're wrong.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.530
I'm not wrong.

00:10:28.530 --> 00:10:29.460
You're wrong!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:32.260
Everything... is yours to toy with.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:37.530
Release it. Open up. Kill... everything.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:44.850
Until everything disappears from before your eyes.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:02.430
Hey, what's your problem?

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.520
Don't defy me. Your molecules shall scatter like sand.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.240
You... what did you do?

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:18.950
God. Devil. Hero. Monster. What will you scum call me?

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:30.110
This bastard... Finish him off!

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:35.370
I offer up this contract, to unleash the power of the spirit which envelops the air!

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:46.500
Analyze existence. Release.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:49.970
A god...

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.400
First comes destruction.

00:11:53.400 --> 00:11:57.290
I bring forth nothing. I bless nothing. I save nothing.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:01.170
I just erase, completely. Shatter.

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:08.890
Monster-

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.380
Break.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.390
Disappear.

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:17.000
Collapse. Burst.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.820
What is this?

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:39.220
My power... The contract is different...

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:43.840
Erase... everything...

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:49.800
R-Ryner...

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.500
Ryner!

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:53.720
You two are dangerous... Die-

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:57.570
Damned... eyes... closing...

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:05.140
Stop... don't... close...

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:10.140
Close them!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.350
Stop... you...

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:21.490
Ryner. Hey, can you hear me?

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:22.920
Ryner!

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:30.090
Again.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.790
Reinforcements?

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.250
Senseless.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:27.770
Stop!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.720
Hmph, you monster.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:35.980
You should have just behaved, and stayed shut away in school.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:39.560
Kiefer... Is she still alive?

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.090
She's already been thrown into prison here.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.980
To begin with, who would have expected her to come back?

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:49.950
Years ago, the eldest of her sisters died in a spy crackdown.

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:53.870
The remaining two received our country's reeducation.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:58.630
We had the younger sister remain here, as a sign of loyalty to our country.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:02.880
Wouldn't it be quicker to just say that you took her hostage?

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.500
She was a foolish girl as well.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:11.960
Even though her younger sister died long ago, in the end, she was worthless.

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:15.240
Nothing is accomplished as long as the Astal brat still lives.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:17.580
So, he was your real target.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:21.970
Do you have any idea how severe of a reprimand we received from those people?

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:25.860
Is that what you called me here for? To complain and moan?

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:29.530
Mind your tongue, monster!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:33.470
Ow... That one right now hurt a little.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.950
Of course it did! Are you mocking me?

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:41.300
You're the one doing the mocking here. I'm always the one being mocked.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.250
I've had enough punishment.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.320
Could you throw me in jail before I drop dead?

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:53.950
The King will grant one request, with your imprisonment.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.670
I'd sure like to stop this bleeding, but...

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:12.010
Hey, Kiefer. If you keep taking afternoon naps, your grades will drop.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:16.530
What's this? What are you doing here, Ryner?

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.250
Well, what should I say?

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.540
This is such a pa-

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.670
If you say that this is pain, I'll beat you down.

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:26.760
Don't hit me! Relax. The bleeding will start again.

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:28.460
How did you get those injuries?

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.420
Forget the injuries. There's something I have to tell you.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:38.770
Your younger sister is gone.
Apparently, she was killed some time ago.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.670
How do you know that, Ryner?

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:52.080
I see. I see it now. You're another Roland pawn, aren't you?

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:58.090
I didn't want to hear it. I didn't want to hear that my sister died!

00:16:58.090 --> 00:17:00.340
Not from you, certainly!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.670
You knew it all? You knew that, and laughed?

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:07.110
When I told you I loved you...

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:11.120
...were you laughing at me for being such a foolish girl?

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:16.670
I had a vague idea that my sister might be dead.

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:19.470
But what could I do?

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:22.190
I... I...

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:26.170
Why do we have wars?

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:30.910
I've got no interest in who owns what land.

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:35.240
That's why I said I liked afternoon naps the most.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.860
Tahile, Tony, and Fahle all died senseless deaths.

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.310
What are you saying?

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:44.350
It must be the motivated guys who start wars.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:48.130
But the guys without motivation always get sucked into them.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:51.350
So what should the guys with no motivation do?

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:55.550
I, unlike Sion, have never wanted to be involved

00:17:55.550 --> 00:17:57.770
in troublesome things like changing the country.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:02.140
Is there some place where I could just take afternoon naps,

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:03.640
and live my life without hurting anyone?

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:08.980
What? Hey... Kiefer, did I just say something strange?

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:12.190
Are you almost ready?

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:15.770
Oh, right! Okay, Kiefer, come here for a second.

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:17.260
What?

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:18.600
Don't worry about it, don't worry about it.

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:24.270
Congratulations on your your release.

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.280
Congratulations to me for my imprisonment.

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:28.680
What's going on?

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:31.390
You satisfied with this as your request?

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:33.950
It's perfect. Deal concluded.

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:35.350
What's this all about?

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:39.020
Written orders. Release of Kiefer Knolles,

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:41.150
in exchange for Ryner Lute's imprisonment.

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:46.020
Just who are you? A fiend so great you can make direct deals with the military?

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.620
Not really.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:51.530
Why would you do that, Ryner?

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:55.700
I betrayed everyone. I got everyone killed...

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:59.980
People don't kill people. Monsters do.

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:04.550
War is a monster. Kingdoms are monsters. Greed is a monster.

00:19:05.650 --> 00:19:08.580
And I... I'm a monster, too.

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:10.790
But you're human, Kiefer.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:15.550
In here, I can rule as the king of the Kingdom of Afternoon Naps.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.180
Kiefer, go outside, and...

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:28.290
Now I know why I fell for you, Ryner.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:32.860
Because you were so unmotivated, I never felt like I had to be cautious around you.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:34.430
Like I could be at ease, for once.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:36.760
That's what I'd thought, but I was wrong.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.860
It's really because you're kind.

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:43.240
And... because you're strong.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:49.870
Ryner, you're not a monster. I guarantee it.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.750
Thank you, Ryner. I'll live on.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.030
And mark my words, I'll...

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.260
I'm going.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:03.210
Open up.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:15.340
That surprised me. I thought I was going to suffocate.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.880
What's wrong? Are you injured?

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.840
A little.

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:27.300
Are you a fool, volunteering to be imprisoned?

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:30.260
It was hard getting visitation rights here.

00:20:30.260 --> 00:20:32.660
You didn't have to bother.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:36.340
I'm just being kept in a prison cell instead of a school, now.

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.260
What's this?

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:50.860
I'm leaving a horse in the northern woods tonight.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:53.880
If you do that, you'll be a suspect.

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:58.140
They don't have the guts to imprison a war hero.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:01.390
It could ruin your good name as a hero.

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.770
I've managed up 'til now.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:08.380
You seem to have a lot of people who wish misfortune upon you.

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:12.870
Please, Ryner, hear me out. This is the only chance we'll have.

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:16.370
I can't guarantee that I'll be able to visit you after this.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:19.820
And I'm not confident in myself anymore.

00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:26.250
My friends are dead. A war has started. The fact that I'm not king right now...

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.860
Those are all failures, on my part.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:34.370
Ryner?

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:37.300
It's too much of a bother.

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:40.020
Besides, who knows what'll happen if things go well?

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:42.610
Ryner, do you want to stay like this?

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:45.180
I'm enjoying afternoon naps at my leisure here.

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:46.720
What will afternoon naps accomplish?!

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:50.310
I'll take an afternoon nap, and think about it after that.

00:21:50.310 --> 00:21:51.150
Ryner!

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:54.980
It's time. Sir Sion, are you ready to go?

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:00.760
Then... I'm going back to being locked up for a bit.

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:04.480
When you consider that this place gives three square meals a day, it's pretty nice.

00:22:06.830 --> 00:22:08.670
See you later, Sion.

00:22:10.020 --> 00:22:12.470
Yeah, later.

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:21.060
<i>I've decided.</i>

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:26.260
<i>Now that I've lost everything, I won't be led astray any longer.</i>

00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:29.570
<i>Ryner, I will certainly...</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:36.690
If you had used that power sooner, everyone would not have had to die!

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:41.260
It never changes...

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:45.410
War really does suck.

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:51.120
Why would anyone want to have war? It's a pain just thinking about it.

00:22:51.730 --> 00:22:53.160
Lights out!

00:22:57.660 --> 00:23:00.180
A lot happened today.

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:04.500
Not much will happen tomorrow.

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:19.220
Well, that just means I've got plenty of time now.

00:24:51.500 --> 00:24:53.210
What a real pain in the butt.

00:24:53.410 --> 00:24:55.930
Effort, persistence and all.

00:24:56.660 --> 00:24:58.960
When you're asleep, nothing happens.

00:24:59.630 --> 00:25:01.470
That would've been just fine for me.

00:25:02.440 --> 00:25:04.510
However...
